  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9f1d22babad387de4381b095c41a0a1713be25da.png\" alt=\"Logo\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cyber-goggles/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/1233804(c70039).svg\" alt=\"Supported Versions\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-cyber-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1233804?logo=curseforge&label=&suffix= &style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=e04e14&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-cyber-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/create-cyber-goggles?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix= &style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/ForgeStove/CreateCyberGoggles?tab=readme-ov-file#MIT-1-ov-file\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/ForgeStove/CreateCyberGoggles?style=flat&color=900c3f\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcreate-cyber-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://badges.crowdin.net/create-cyber-goggles/localized.svg\" alt=\"Crowdin\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdeepwiki.com%252fForgeStove%252fCreateCyberGoggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://deepwiki.com/badge.svg\" alt=\"Ask DeepWiki\"></a></p>\n<h2>概述 / Overview</h2>\n<p><strong>Create: Cyber Goggles</strong> 是<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>機械動力</strong></a>的用戶端附屬模組，為其提供了模組化的輔助功能。</p>\n<p><strong>Create: Cyber Goggles</strong> is a client-side mod for <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Create</strong></a>, providing modular assistance features.</p>\n<h2>版本 / Versions</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Minecraft</th>\n<th>Forge</th>\n<th>Fabric/Quilt</th>\n<th>NeoForge</th>\n<th>Create: Cyber Goggles</th>\n<th>Create</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.8-26.1.2</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>3.0+</td>\n<td>6.0+ (Create-Fly)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.21.1</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>1.x~7.x</td>\n<td>6.0+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.20.1</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>1.x~7.x</td>\n<td>1.x: 0.5+, 6.0+; 2.x~7.x: 6.0+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1.18.2-1.19.2</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1.x</td>\n<td>0.5+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>本地化 / Localization</h2>\n<p>歡迎透過 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcreate-cyber-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a> 協助將此模組翻譯成更多語言！</p>\n<p>Welcome to help translate this mod into more languages on <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fcreate-cyber-goggles\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crowdin</a>!</p>\n<h2>致謝 / Credits</h2>\n<p>本專案使用了以下模組的程式碼：</p>\n<p>This project uses code derived from the following mods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MisterPeModder/ShulkerBoxTooltip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ShulkerBoxTooltip</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Alex-Guha/schematician\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Schematician</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/catboybinary/O123456789\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">O123456789</a></li>\n</ul>",
